From 73525b297c35832c0adac1eb12d4d4e4b2748550 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khai Cao <khai.cao.xk@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:33:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [tfm patch] Add support for remote NS build

Add remote non-secure build support for multi-core RA devices.

Changes include:
- Add _RA_REMOTE_NONSECURE build support
- Clock calculation support from compile-time configuration
- Support releasing CM33 when the Secure Extension is disabled
  (no CM33 secure partitions are available)

Signed-off-by: Khai Cao <khai.cao.xk@renesas.com>
